<Track #add-provider-request-sqlite-ledger version="1" apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "completed" goal = "逐次持久化真实 provider request attempt，以 SQLite 现场替代对 History state 的单一推断" description = "新增通用 provider request observation port、Bun SQLite support、显式 CLI 开关，并重跑目标 session 分析连续请求。" question_mode = "decision-tree" question_severity = "auto" commit_mode = "manual" created_at = "2026-07-18T11:33:30Z" updated_at = "2026-07-18T14:04:19Z" } (
  <Ports { scope = "track" } [
    <MaterialBundle { role = "input" name = "behavior-deltas" domain = "behavior" path = "vfs://./behavior_deltas/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "behavior" domain = "codument" path = "vfs://@/codument/behaviors/" }>
  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_add-provider-request-sqlite-ledger { name = "add-provider-request-sqlite-ledger" } (
    <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKQ>
    建立 provider request attempt 的独立 SQLite 可观测现场，并用目标 session 验证。
    </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKQ>
    <SubNodes [
      <TaskGroup #P1 { name = "Request observation contract 与 attempt capture" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKR>
        先用失败测试定义逐 attempt 事实、身份、复制脱敏、不变性和 fail-open，再扩展 provider runtime。
        </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKR>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKS>
          每个真实 retry attempt 恰好一条 observation
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKS>
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKT>
          未调用 provider 的 build/preflight 不产生 observation
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKT>
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKV>
          启用/禁用和 sink 失败均不改变请求输入与调用语义
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKV>
        ]>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T1.1" name = "定义 typed port 并接入真实 provider attempt 边界" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKW>
            在 ai-organ-contract 增加 ProviderRequestObservationData/Port，扩展 provider runtime identity，在 retry callback 调用 driver 前同步 append 脱敏副本，并用 fake driver 覆盖 retry、error、abort、无调用和源对象不变性；ai-core-contract 不新增 provider-specific contract。
            </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKW>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKX>
              observation 包含 schema/session/actor/turn/provider-call/attempt/provider/model/adapter/driver/capture-layer 与完整有序请求副本
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKX>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKY>
              retry 每个真实 attempt 一条，preflight-only 零条
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKY>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC3" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKZ>
              脱敏只作用于深复制 observation，原请求深度等价
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XKZ>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC4" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM0>
              port 抛错时 provider 调用与结果保持，且产生有界诊断
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM0>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.2" name = "下沉到真实 transport send 边界" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM1>
            扩展 observation identity 与 typed wire callback，把 capture 从 outer prepared contract 下沉到各低层 adapter 的 fetch/WebSocket send 前；目标路径覆盖 Responses continuity、tool-only input 和 WS→HTTP fallback。
            </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM1>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM2>
              observation 区分 provider call、provider retry attempt 与 transport type/ordinal
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM2>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM3>
              普通 HTTP observation body 深度等于实际 fetch body 的脱敏副本
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM3>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC3" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM4>
              Responses WS continuity/tool-output observation 包含实际 previous_response_id 与增量 input
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM4>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC4" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM5>
              WS 失败后 HTTP fallback 形成第二条 observation，body 等于实际 fallback fetch body
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM5>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC5" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM6>
              observer 失败不改变 send/fallback 行为，outer messages/tools 仅作 source correlation
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM6>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Hooks [
          <Hook { on = "phase:after" } (
            <AttractorCheck { use = "coding" }>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "SQLite support 与 terminal capability binding" status = "DONE" order = 1 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM7>
        实现 session-local Bun SQLite port、CLI 显式开关、runtime lifecycle 绑定和查询测试。
        </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM7>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM8>
          SQLite schema/WAL/reopen/query/0600/redaction 测试通过
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM8>
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM9>
          terminal 不读取或组装 provider request
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XM9>
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMA>
          capture 默认关闭且 storage-disabled/ephemeral 语义明确
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMA>
        ]>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T2.1" name = "实现 SQLite ledger 并接入 exec 开关" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMB>
            在 app 顶层 terminal/organ-support 使用 bun:sqlite 实现 append-only Effect 和 binding factory，通过 runtime config 向 terminal/organ 注入 port，保持 organ 不反向依赖 support；为 exec 增加 --capture-provider-requests，并覆盖 CLI mapping、runtime refresh、dispose、disabled 和 SQLite 集成测试。
            </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMB>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T2.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMC>
              账本位于 session/observability/provider-requests.sqlite，schema-versioned、WAL、transactional、0600
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMC>
              <Criterion { id = "T2.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMD>
              request row 与 ordered message rows 可 reopen/query 并关联 attempt identity
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMD>
              <Criterion { id = "T2.1-AC3" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XME>
              CLI flag 显式启用，默认关闭，terminal 只绑定 port/path
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XME>
              <Criterion { id = "T2.1-AC4" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMF>
              adapter refresh 与 runtime dispose 保持同一 observation lifecycle
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMF>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T2.2" name = "持久化 transport attempt 与 exact body" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMG>
            扩展 app-top SQLite schema/rows 保存 transport type/ordinal 与脱敏 exact body，保留 ordered source messages，并用低层 transport 集成测试证明数据库内容对应实际 send 入参。
            </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMG>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T2.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMH>
              SQLite 可按 provider attempt 查询有序 transport attempts 与 exact body
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMH>
              <Criterion { id = "T2.2-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMJ>
              schema/reopen/query 支持 HTTP、WebSocket 和 fallback，SQLite Effect 仍只在 organ-support
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMJ>
              <Criterion { id = "T2.2-AC3" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMK>
              目标 session capture 所需 identity 在初始/refresh adapter 与 dispose 生命周期中保持
              </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMK>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Hooks [
          <Hook { on = "phase:after" } (
            <AttractorCheck { use = "coding" }>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "目标 session 现场采集与重新诊断" status = "DONE" order = 2 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMM>
        使用当前源码和 capture flag 精确恢复目标 session，查询 SQLite 中连续 provider requests，再给出基于实际请求的根因。
        </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMM>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMN>
          SQLite 包含本次运行每个真实 provider attempt
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMN>
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMP>
          连续请求的 messages/tools/body 顺序与差异已查询并保存
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMP>
          <Criterion ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMQ>
          结论明确区分实际 request 证据与 History/projection state 旁证
          </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMQ>
        ]>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T3.1" name = "重跑目标 session 并分析 SQLite 请求现场" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMR>
            记录账本前态，用 --capture-provider-requests 恢复指定 workspace/session，出现重复时停止放大；使用只读 SQL 比较连续请求的 role、tool pair、dynamic overlay/projection 和 request digest，形成最终诊断。
            </?01M05F1PKR7FYFNRAYZPH97XMR>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKS40QK7R0YBHX0CEMP>
              同一 session/actor 恢复且账本新增 attempt rows
              </?01M05F1PKS40QK7R0YBHX0CEMP>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKS40QK7R0YBHX0CEMQ>
              每个实际 provider 请求的完整有序数据可由独立 SQLite 查询
              </?01M05F1PKS40QK7R0YBHX0CEMQ>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC3" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKS40QK7R0YBHX0CEMR>
              连续请求差异和重复模式有 SQL 证据，不再只根据 History state 推断
              </?01M05F1PKS40QK7R0YBHX0CEMR>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC4" checked = true } ?01M05F1PKS40QK7R0YBHX0CEMS>
              未清理或回退两个 dirty worktree，敏感字段未进入报告
              </?01M05F1PKS40QK7R0YBHX0CEMS>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Hooks [
          <Hook { on = "phase:after" } (
            <AttractorCheck { use = "coding" }>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    ]>
  )>
)>
